{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_rift_scar","model_identifier":"lair_rift_scar","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_rift_scar\n\nLair: rift scar (C6, red demons, from night 45), 6 m (213 u) long.\n\nA burnt crack in the ground: a zigzag split 216 u long, glowing molten orange inside (`glow_crack_*`), widest in the middle, with jagged slabs of black rock pushed up along both lips (tallest at the centre, glowing cracks on the faces toward the split) on a scorched, cracked ground plate. Footprint 16 x 8 terrain columns (256 x 128 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -124.0..124.0, y 0.0..36.5, z -60.0..60.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- crack and rock lips: 220 x 42 x 90 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (impassable); scorched plate 248 x 0.5 x 120 is walkable\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 1.5, 0)\n- `fx_glow_0` on `root` at (-70, 4, 0)\n- `fx_glow_1` on `root` at (0, 4, 0)\n- `fx_glow_2` on `root` at (70, 4, 0)\n- `fx_smoke` on `root` at (0, 10, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: centre of the crack (demons climb out); `fx_glow_0..2`: orange point lights along it; `fx_smoke`: heat shimmer / smoke.\n- Lit cubes: glow_crack_*.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_rift_scar_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_rift_scar\n\nLair: rift scar (C6, red demons, from night 45), 6 m (213 u) long.\n\nA burnt crack in the ground: a zigzag split 216 u long, glowing molten orange inside (`glow_crack_*`), widest in the middle, with jagged slabs of black rock pushed up along both lips (tallest at the centre, glowing cracks on the faces toward the split) on a scorched, cracked ground plate. Footprint 16 x 8 terrain columns (256 x 128 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -124.0..124.0, y 0.0..36.5, z -60.0..60.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- crack and rock lips: 220 x 42 x 90 (w x h x d) centred on the origin, from y = 0 (impassable); scorched plate 248 x 0.5 x 120 is walkable\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 1.5, 0)\n- `fx_glow_0` on `root` at (-70, 4, 0)\n- `fx_glow_1` on `root` at (0, 4, 0)\n- `fx_glow_2` on `root` at (70, 4, 0)\n- `fx_smoke` on `root` at (0, 10, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: centre of the crack (demons climb out); `fx_glow_0..2`: orange point lights along it; `fx_smoke`: heat shimmer / smoke.\n- Lit cubes: glow_crack_*.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_rift_scar_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"scorched_ground","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-124.0,0.0,-60.0],"to":[124.0,0.5,60.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,383,248.0,383.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,385,120.0,385.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,384,248.0,384.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[120,385,240.0,385.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,248.0,120.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f95374a9-4d9c-5acd-909f-062112533429"},{"name":"glow_crack_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-104.0,0.0,-13.827272727272728],"to":[-80.0,3.0,5.8272727272